# SPIDER's own engines (synth.c, BOARD_SMK37): a new project is the kit, mono (after the SH-101), poly (after the
# Juno-106), acid (X0X's 303), then LOOM-8's; mono and poly sound, poly's chord through its chorus; their pages
wait 300
expect par1.engine 8
expect par2.engine 12
expect par3.engine 11
expect par4.engine 10
expect par2.vmode 1
wav spider_sounds.wav
# mono: a bass note
turn ALGO 1
wait 60
expect trk 2
peakreset
key 0 down
wait 400
key 0 up
wait 400
expect peak_db_min -36
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# poly: a chord, three voices, the chorus on
turn ALGO 1
wait 60
expect trk 3
expect par3.x3 1
peakreset
key 12 down
key 16 down
key 19 down
wait 200
expect voices 3
wait 400
key 12 up
key 16 up
key 19 up
wait 800
expect peak_db_min -30
expect peak_db_max -0.5
wavstop
tap EDIT
wait 60
expect page Engine
shot poly_engine.png
turn SELECT 3
wait 60
expect page Sub
shot poly_sub.png
turn ALGO -1
wait 60
expect trk 2
turn SELECT -3
wait 60
expect page Engine
shot mono_engine.png
